  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/smol-machines/smolvm/zipball/v1.32.2",
  "body": "## What's Changed\n* chore(nix): bump flake to 1.32.0 by @github-actions[bot] in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1972\n* Let a pause pin later layers after one cannot be linked, instead of failing to create the pin directory again. by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1973\n* Bump smolvm to 1.32.0 by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1965\n* Bump smolvm to 1.32.1 by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1974\n* Record a VMM that smolvm stopped through the API, a recovery or a kill as stopped, not as killed by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1976\n* Let checkpoint store workers read their own chunks by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1977\n* Document named and numeric exec user resolution by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1979\n* Bound the node checkpoint store so incremental checkpoints no longer accumulate forever by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1981\n* Bump smolvm to 1.32.2 by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1982\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/compare/v1.32.0...v1.32.2",
